    "answer": {
      "short": "Both columns total $1026$ goals. Every goal is counted once for the team that scored it and once against its opponent.",
      "worked": "After round six, the Goals For figures are $142,157,120,160,132,105,97,113$, in the original table order.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total goals for}&=142+157+120+160+132+105+97+113\\\\\\text{Total goals for}&=1026\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe Goals Against figures are $111,117,123,132,128,140,120,155$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Total goals against}&=111+117+123+132+128+140+120+155\\\\\\text{Total goals against}&=1026\\end{align*}$$\n\nEach goal adds one to the scoring team’s Goals For and one to its opponent’s Goals Against, so the two totals are equal.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
